# SKILL.md: Mwingiliano wa Sehemu za Kikanda (Ulinganisho wa Grafu na Jedwali)

## Maelezo
Ujuzi huu unaelezea jinsi ya kulinganisha hali kati ya sehemu mbili tofauti za D3 (grafu ya duara na jedwali la HTML) ili kuchagua kitu kwenye eneo moja kionyeshe kitu kinacholingana kwenye eneo lingine.

## Usakinishaji/Mipangilio
Inahitaji D3.js v6 na HTML/CSS ya kawaida.

## Mifano ya Msimbo

### Mantiki ya Kuonyesha
```javascript
// Kazi ya kushughulikia uchaguzi
function highlightSelection(ticker) {
  // Onyesha duara
  bubbles.classed("selected", d => d.ticker === ticker)
         .style("stroke", "red")
         .style("stroke-width", "3px");

  // Onyesha safu ya jedwali
  const rows = d3.selectAll("table tbody tr");
  rows.classed("selected", d => d.ticker === ticker)
      .style("background-color", "#e0f7fa");
}

// Matukio ya kufungua duara
bubbles.on("click", function(event, d) {
  // Ondoa uonyeshaji wa awali
  bubbles.classed("selected", false).style("stroke", "#fff").style("stroke-width", "1.5px");
  d3.selectAll("table tbody tr").classed("selected", false).style("background-color", "transparent");

  // Onyesha sasa
  highlightSelection(d.ticker);
});

// Matukio ya kufungua safu ya jedwali
rows.on("click", function(event, d) {
  bubbles.classed("selected", false).style("stroke", "#fff").style("stroke-width", "1.5px");
  d3.selectAll("table tbody tr").classed("selected", false).style("background-color", "transparent");

  highlightSelection(d.ticker);
});
```

### CSS ya Kuonyesha
```css
.selected {
  stroke: red !important;
  stroke-width: 3px !important;
}

tr.selected {
  background-color: #e0f7fa !important;
}
```

## Mifumo ya Matumizi
1. **Kitambulisho Kipekee**: Hakikisha seti zote mbili za data zina fungu kipekee (kwa mfano, `ticker`) ili kulinganisha safu na duara.
2. **Udhibiti wa Hali**: Ondoa uonyeshaji wa awali kabla ya kutumia mpya ili kuepuka mchanganyiko wa kuonekana.
3. **Kugawa Matukio**: Viambatanishi vya matukio kwenye kioo cha wazazi ikiwezekana, au tumia `.on()` ya D3 kwenye uchaguzi.

