# Node.js में: import { OBJExporter } from 'three/examples/jsm/exporters/OBJExporter.js';
``` 

## Code Examples

### Basic Usage
```javascript
import * as THREE from 'three';
import { OBJExporter } from 'three/examples/jsm/exporters/OBJExporter.js';

// मान लीजिए 'scene' आपके Three.js दृश्य का ऑब्जेक्ट है
