```

### Kuzuia CLS kwa Kutumia Aspect Ratio
Tumia `fill` pamoja na `object-fit` ili kuhakikisha picha inajaza nafasi yake bila kubadilisha ukubwa wa container.

```jsx
<div className="image-container" style={{ position: 'relative', width: '100%', height: '0', paddingBottom: '75%' }}> {/* 4:3 aspect ratio */}
  <Image
    src="/product.jpg"
    alt="Picha ya Bidhaa"
    fill
    sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw"
    className="object-cover"
